     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> anova</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">df_com_cfa</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">df_com_cfa2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Scaled</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Chi</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Squared</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Difference</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Test</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">method </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">“</span><span style=\"color:#000\">satorra</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2000</span><span style=\"color:#660\">”)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>lavaan NOTE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#606\">The</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">“</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Chisq</span><span style=\"color:#660\">”</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> column contains standard test statistics</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">not</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> the<br>    robust test that should be reported per model</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> A robust difference<br>    test </span><span style=\"color:#008\">is</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> of two standard </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">not</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> robust</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> statistics</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> <br>              </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Df</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> AIC BIC </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Chisq</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Chisq</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> diff </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Df</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> diff          </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Pr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Chisq</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\">    <br>df_com_cfa  </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1550</span><span style=\"color:#000\">         </span><span style=\"color:#066\">36595</span><span style=\"color:#000\">                                           <br>df_com_cfa2 </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1558</span><span style=\"color:#000\">         </span><span style=\"color:#066\">40530</span><span style=\"color:#000\">       </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3510</span><span style=\"color:#000\">       </span><span style=\"color:#066\">8</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.0000000000000002</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">***</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">---</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Signif</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> codes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">‘***’</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.001</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">‘**’</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.01</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">‘*’</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.05</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">‘.’</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">‘</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">’</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Which model is better,df_com_cfa or df_com_cfa2?<br></div></div>"
